PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt1Intro::
    .string "Ghost POKéMON from other regions\n"
    .string "are wandering this tower. TEAM\l"
    .string "ECLIPSE is collecting them all!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt1Defeat::
    .string "I give up!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt1PostBattle::
    .string "Those lost little ghosts drifted\n"
    .string "here with the storm. Collectors pay\l"
    .string "a fortune for them!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt2Intro::
    .string "The old man upstairs keeps setting\n"
    .string "the lost POKéMON free. We're\l"
    .string "teaching him a lesson!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt2Defeat::
    .string "Please!\n"
    .string "No more!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt2PostBattle::
    .string "Fine! Go save the old man. Our boss\n"
    .string "NOX has bigger plans anyway!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt3Intro::
    .string "You again? TEAM ECLIPSE never\n"
    .string "gives up!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt3Defeat::
    .string "Don't fight us ECLIPSES!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt3PostBattle::
    .string "M-CORE is almost ready.\n"
    .string "Then even GROUDON will obey\l"
    .string "TEAM ECLIPSE!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_MrFujiThankYouFollowMe::
    .string "MR. FUJI: Heh?\n"
    .string "You came to save me?\p"
    .string "Thank you. But, I came here of my\n"
    .string "own free will.\p"
    .string "I came to calm the spirit of\n"
    .string "KARAKARA's mother.\p"
    .string "I think GARAGARA's spirit has\n"
    .string "finally left us.\p"
    .string "I must thank you for your kind\n"
    .string "concern.\p"
    .string "Follow me to my home, POKéMON\n"
    .string "HOUSE, at the foot of this tower.$"

